The `getRenderingHints()` API returns the standard Java 2D rendering hints configuration map used by a specific `Resizer` implementation. It sits at the low-level image processing layer, providing the exact configuration (such as interpolation, antialiasing, or dithering settings) that the resizer applies to the `Graphics2D` context when drawing the scaled image.

